Z||000009||Oreif||11-12-2000||01:51 PM||||If you read the AD carefully you will notice he states: "the redesigned suspension was BASED on the Lotus sports cars." Which is a true statement. The configuration is simular to the Lotus. It is NOT a Lotus nor designed by Lotus suspension. It is based on the Lotus concept of using unequal length control arms to improve geometery and thus improve handling. But just like how the original rumors got started, someone sees the word "Lotus" and "suspension" and ASSUMES Lotus designed or built the suspension.||||reg||4
